{"availability":"available","full":"kamrangul87/autodun-ai-assistant","name":"autodun-ai-assistant","description":"Conversational AI agent routing users across the Autodun platform tools","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-12-23T09:30:53Z","updated":"2026-04-30T06:47:47Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ai.autodun.com","topics":["automative","nextjs","typescript","uk","vercel"],"demo":"https://ai.autodun.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:28.312Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:28.312Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:28.312Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:28.312Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Structured automotive intelligence for UK drivers — not a chatbot.","Ask about MOT risk, EV charging near you, or buying a used car. Get a structured, explainable answer — not a paragraph of guesses.","Autodun AI Assistant is an intent-routing automotive intelligence layer built on top of real UK vehicle data. It classifies a driver's natural language question into one of three specialised workflows, runs a dedicated analysis pipeline for that workflow, and returns a deterministic, structured response — with risk scores, fix/monitor decisions, and direct tool links."],"features":["motpreparation — triggered by MOT keywords, VRM patterns (AB12 CDE), mileage/age mentions","evchargingreadiness — triggered by EV/charger keywords or a detected UK postcode","usedcarbuyer — triggered by purchase/buying intent signals","unknownoutofscope — clearly out of domain (visa, health, finance, etc.)","Each intent routes to its own dedicated API handler — not a shared prompt template."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kamrangul87/autodun-ai-assistant/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3af23b49c585f9cb304753f0236fe7d5fe04bef0937bc536c23eee7c65a20f53","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:28.556Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2